these next:\n1. a **plain-English explanation** with no Azure jargon,  \n2. a **comparison to OpenAI Assistants / Responses API / LangGraph**, or  \n3. a **hello-world architecture** for using Foundry Agent Service in an app."},"sequence_number":187}

